opencode-hop
=================

This is an unofficial build of opencode. It is not built by the OpenCode team, not
endorsed by them, and not affiliated with them in any way. Issues, questions, and
support requests belong to this distribution, not to the upstream project.

Upstream project: https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode


